ion issues (grumpy, uncooperative). Both have concerns. B also has technical competence (weather, computer). C's technical competence not mentioned. So B seems stronger overall. So we can keep recommending B, but we need to bring up C for discussion.\n\nThus our contribution: agree with B, but highlight need to discuss C and D, especially crew cooperation and decision quality. Provide evidence for C and D. Then state we still recommend B for now.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote for Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
